    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ēlīsĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		elido. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A striking out</i>, <i>forcing
			out</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lacrimae,</span>”
				<i>pressing out</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 99, 18</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			the later grammarians, <i>the striking out of a
			letter</i>, <i>elision.</i></div>
